{"asset_key":"ep5/env_story_15304300","episode":"ep5","category":"env_story","story_id":"15304300","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1530430001:1":{"text":"知らないのか？本物の狩猟神様が降臨したんだよ！","source_cn":"你还不知道吗？真正的狩猎神降临了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A44A39402B62FE8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1530430002:1":{"text":"だとしたらホーリンといえど、神殿の近くにある追影の野営地を攻めることはできないだろ。","source_cn":"她降临之后，呼临人肯定不敢再进攻离神殿很近的逐影营地了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x043F548E84015F00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1530430003:1":{"text":"そういえば、子どもたちはどうする？戦火が及ばないよう、やっぱ樹怒の谷に送るべきかな？","source_cn":"对了，那孩子们呢？还要不要把他们送往树怒山谷，免得战火...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C5F9FC4FC771B59","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1530430004:1":{"text":"必要ないだろ。俺が思うに、今の野営地は樹怒の谷より安全だよ。","source_cn":"应该没这个必要了吧。要我说，逐影营地现在比树怒山谷更安全。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C62023CCC21298B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:无尾":{"text":"テイルレス","source":"无尾","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:闪":{"text":"フラシア","source":"闪","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}